# Jobs from the notice board, start to finish, plus the money around them (fares, food).
# SPOILERS: the answers to every job.
# Starts the village chapter fresh: day 1, 20,000원 in your pocket.
# Day 1's board: key, gimbap, bag.  Day 2's: whatever's left (gimbap, letter, cash).

chapter village
idle
expect money=20000&day=1&time:morning
spot Front gate
spot Village hall
expect @hall
#@ Jobs · the notice board
job key
idle
expect job:key
noboard key

# --- the missing key: 수진 is home in the morning; the river is where she really was
spot Back to the alley
spot Front gate
talk sujin
idle
talk sujin
choose About the job
choose I don't know yet
idle
spot Front gate
spot Right path
spot Bus stop
spot Path behind the bus stop
talk haraboji
idle
talk haraboji
choose About the job
idle
expect key_asked&st_key_river
map madang
talk sujin
choose About the job
choose 강에 있어요
idle
expect jobdone:key&!job:key&money=24000

# --- the gimbap thief, answered wrong on purpose: it's off the board for today
map hall
job gimbap
idle
map sikdang
talk ajeossi
idle
talk ajeossi
choose About the job
choose I don't know yet
idle
map gang
talk haraboji
choose About the job
idle
map sikdang
talk ajeossi
choose About the job
choose 지호예요
idle
expect !job:gimbap&!jobdone:gimbap
noboard gimbap

# --- the lost bag: 아저씨 saw a kid take it; 지호 says he didn't; the owner gets it back in the evening
map hall
job bag
idle
map sikdang
talk ajeossi
choose About the job
idle
expect st_bag_kid
wait
map golmok
talk jiho
idle
talk jiho
choose About the job
choose Point out what doesn't add up
contradict bag_lie + bag_kid
idle
expect ev_bag_bag
#@ Jobs · bag found, evening coming
wait
map sikdang
talk staff
idle
talk staff
choose About the job
present bag_bag
idle
expect jobdone:bag&money=29000
map madang
sleep
expect day=2&time:morning

# --- day 2: the gimbap thief is back on the board, and starts over clean
map hall
expect st_gimbap_cat
job gimbap
idle
expect !st_gimbap_cat&!gimbap_asked
map gang
talk haraboji
idle
talk haraboji
choose About the job
idle
map sikdang
talk ajeossi
idle
talk ajeossi
choose About the job
choose 고양이예요
idle
expect jobdone:gimbap&money=35000

# --- the cash box: a bus ride to the market (1,500원), a snack, and no bus fare home on purpose: walk
map hall
job cash
idle
map jeong
spot Take the bus
choose Ride to the market
idle
expect @sijang&money=33500
#@ Jobs · at the market
talk ajumma
idle
talk ajumma
choose About the job
choose Go and ask the customers first
idle
spot 호떡 cart
choose 호떡 하나 주세요
number 1000
idle
expect money=32500
spot Take the bus back
choose Walk back along the river road
idle
expect @jeong&time:afternoon
map sikdang
talk ajeossi
choose About the job
idle
map madang
spot Workshop
talk sujin
idle
talk sujin
choose About the job
idle
expect cash_asked
wait
map sikdang
talk ajumma
choose About the job
choose Tell her how much is missing
number 3000
choose 수진이에요
idle
expect jobdone:cash&money=40500

# --- dinner: order in Korean, pay with the number pad (wrong first), then treat the table
#@ Jobs · dinner at the restaurant
spot Order food
choose 라면 주세요
number 4000
number 4500
expect money=36000
choose Buy 김밥 for the whole table
idle
expect money=33000

# --- the letter: casual Korean, fishing, and the one who goes fishing with 할아버지
map hall
job letter
idle
map madang
talk sujin
choose About the job
idle
map jeong
talk jiho
idle
talk jiho
choose About the job
choose Give it to him
idle
expect jobdone:letter&money=40000
map hall
noboard letter
noboard bag

# --- too broke for the bus: it tells you, and you stay put
fx money =1000
map jeong
spot Take the bus
choose You can't afford the fare
idle
expect @jeong&money=1000
